## Data

### NASA CEA thermodynamic and transport databases
- Paths: data/thermo.inp, data/trans.inp, data/thermo.lib, data/trans.lib
- Source/References: NASA TP-2002-211556: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/api/citations/20020085330/downloads/20020085330.pdf

### NASA RP-1311 example inputs/outputs
- Paths: samples/*.inp, samples/*.out, source/bind/python/cea/samples/*.out
- Source/References: NASA RP-1311 Part 2: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/api/citations/19960044559/downloads/19960044559.pdf

